      "type": "text",
      "x": 1216,
      "y": 238,
      "width": 342,
      "height": 150,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "·  One row per market: the term it was sent,\n   how many it returned, how many survived\n   filtering\n·  Why a market is absent, in its own words:\n   blocked, rate limited, timed out, captcha,\n   nothing found\n·  Which markets are cooling down, and until\n   when\n·  A way into a captcha the crawler is holding\n   open",
      "originalText": "·  One row per market: the term it was sent,\n   how many it returned, how many survived\n   filtering\n·  Why a market is absent, in its own words:\n   blocked, rate limited, timed out, captcha,\n   nothing found\n·  Which markets are cooling down, and until\n   when\n·  A way into a captcha the crawler is holding\n   open",
